\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 United Auto Workers\uc2  calls for ceasefire in Gaza \u8211\'20\'13 the largest union to do so\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 437 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 December 2023\par 18:40 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 UAW\uc2 , representing 400,000 in the US and over 580,000 retired workers, makes announcement as military operations resume\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United Auto Workers\uc2 , one of the US\u8217\'20\'19s largest labor unions, has come out in support of a ceasefire in Israel and Palestine as a temporary ceasefire ended on Friday with Israel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=&cad=rja&uact=8&ved=2ahUKEwinkrLP4O6CAxUhkWoFHYdSAt4QFnoECBoQAQ&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nbcnews.com%2Fnews%2Fworld%2Fisrael-resumes-gaza-military-operation-hamas-cease-fire-ends-rcna127541&usg=AOvVaw0VStH1S86UuUDJw1erqudV&opi=89978449"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resuming}}}\uc2  military operations in Gaza.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 UAW\uc2  is now the largest union to have called for a ceasefire. It represents 400,000 workers in the US and more than 580,000 retired workers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m proud today to announce that the \uc2 UAW\uc2  international has joined the call for a ceasefire in Israel and Palestine,\u8221\'20\'1D Brandon Mancilla, \uc2 UAW\uc2  director, said at a press conference on Friday outside the White House where protesters have been on hunger strike.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFrom opposing fascism in WWII to mobilizing against apartheid South Africa and the Contra war, the \uc2 UAW\uc2  has consistently stood for justice across the globe. A labor movement that fights for social and economic justice for all workers must always stand against war and for peace.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur international executive board will also be forming a divestment and just transition working group to study the history of Israel and Palestine, our union\u8217\'20\'19s economic ties to the conflict, and explore how we can have a just transition for US workers from war to peace.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ceasefire resolutions among local and national labor unions in the US have been increasing since early October. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/APWUnational/status/1730612306969571366"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 American Postal Workers Union}}}\uc2 , the UE union, the \uc2 California Nurses Association\uc2 , the \uc2 Chicago Teachers Union\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Psltim9URTlwWeKgvouqIrJ3_BmNvGKhGRgjoICpkKU/edit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several other }}}\uc2  local unions and worker groups have issued public calls for an immediate and permanent ceasefire.\par \par \uc2 The announcement comes as the \uc2 UAW\uc2  recently secured historic gains in new union contracts with the Big Three automakers, Ford, \uc2 Stellantis\uc2 , and \uc2 General Motors\uc2 , and have launched a nationwide unionizing campaign aimed at organizing nearly 150,000 workers at 13 other large automakers in the US.\par \par \uc2 In a social media post Shawn Fain, the \uc2 UAW\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recently elected president, said he was \u8220\'20\'1Cproud\u8221\'20\'1D of the decision and that the \uc2 UAW\uc2  had \u8220\'20\'1Cconsistently stood for justice across the globe\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 I am proud that the UAW International Union is calling for a ceasefire in Israel and Palestine. From opposing fascism in WWII to mobilizing against apartheid South Africa and the CONTRA war, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/UAW?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @UAW}}}\uc2  has consistently stood for justice across the globe..\u8212\'20\'14 Shawn Fain (@ShawnFainUAW) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ShawnFainUAW/status/1730641556246298988?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 1, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Both Joe Biden and his likely presidential rival \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  have been courting the \uc2 UAW\uc2  and came out in support of strikers.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231201ejc1002ed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
