\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18They\u8217\'20\'19ve worked us to death\u8217\'20\'19: \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  workers to strike on Black Friday\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2023\par 12:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Four hundred workers in Washington state to strike, alleging the company \u8211\'20\'13 which pays millions to executives \u8211\'20\'13 is not playing fair\par \par \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  workers are planning to strike on Black Friday, alleging unfair labor practices and the retailer\u8217\'20\'19s failure to reach a new union contract deal.\par \par \uc2 Four hundred workers at \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  locations in Washington state are planning action after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ufcw3000.org/news/2023/10/11/macys-bargaining-update-96-vote-to-authorize-a-ulp-strike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 96% }}}\uc2  of workers voted in favor of authorizing the strike in October.\par \par \uc2 In 2021 and 2022, \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/794367/000162828023005942/m-20230302xexx991.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  profits of over $1bn. The company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s202.q4cdn.com/285121676/files/doc_financials/2022/ar/2022ar.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spent}}}\uc2  $600m on stock buybacks and paid out $173m in dividends to shareholders in 2022.\par \par \uc2 The union has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ufcw3000.org/news/2023/11/15/no-deal-reached-with-macys-todaynbspmacys-workers-its-time-to-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticized}}}\uc2  these profits and the \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  chief executive \uc2 Jeff Gennette\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s $11m annual pay package as the company refuses to budge on wage increases the union is asking for in a new contract.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe would like them to share some of those profits so we can have a liveable wage,\u8221\'20\'1D said Azia Domingo, who has worked at \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  in Tukwila, Washington, for 21 years. \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  CEO gets $11m per year while a lot of his workers rely on food banks, and some can\u8217\'20\'19t even afford to see doctors because of the low wages and the expensive healthcare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5418aa2ce4b097579b5c27e5/t/63d46a2d4d425935bd2b0b6b/1674865198666/Macys+Furniture+Gallery+2021+-+2023.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Starting pay}}}\uc2  in the most recent contract with \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  was at or near Washington state\u8217\'20\'19s minimum wage, which goes up to to $16.28 an hour from 1 January.\par \par \uc2 Domingo said low pay has made it difficult to attract and retain workers, while not properly compensating workers who have put in years of service with the company, resulting in chronic understaffing and higher workloads.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA lot of times on the floor there will be one person covering everything \u8211\'20\'13 and that\u8217\'20\'19s hard. More and more people are having to take on more,\u8221\'20\'1D added Domingo. \u8220\'20\'1CWe work long hours. Our job titles keep getting longer and longer, and \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  isn\u8217\'20\'19t wanting to invest in their employees and invest in keeping them long-term.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The union, \uc2 UFCW\uc2  Local 3000, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ufcw3000.org/news/2023/11/15/no-deal-reached-with-macys-todaynbspmacys-workers-its-time-to-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 planning}}}\uc2  a striking workers\u8217\'20\'19 parade on Black Friday at the Macy\u8217\'20\'19s Southcenter location in Tukwila, outside Seattle, to kick off the strike. Other workers represented by the union and community members will also join. Thousands of people have signed on to a petition supporting the workers\u8217\'20\'19 strike and pledging not to cross the picket line.\par \par \uc2 Liisa Luick, another long-time sales associate at \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  in Lynnwood, Washington, claimed she had been subjected to unfair labor practices. Luick said she was suspended for two weeks without pay last year after calling the police in response to an individual posing a safety threat at the store. She said workers should not have to fear losing their jobs or being reprimanded for calling emergency services.\par \par \uc2 Other unfair labor practice charges filed by the union include being prohibited by \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  from speaking to workers in the workplace, surveillance of union members and bargaining in bad faith.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve had assaults in our stores, and we\u8217\'20\'19ve had shootings out in our parking lots at the time when we have to walk out to our cars with no consideration at all,\u8221\'20\'1D said Luick.\par \par \uc2 She said pay had lagged far behind inflation even as \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  has been immensely profitable, as executives have been paid multimillion-dollar salaries, and as the company has put lots of money into publicity campaigns such as the \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  Thanksgiving Day Parade.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19ve worked us to death on skeletal staffing, and it\u8217\'20\'19s just not fair,\u8221\'20\'1D said Luick. \u8220\'20\'1CWhen we see that they\u8217\'20\'19ve made all these billions, when they pledged to put money back into the business, they\u8217\'20\'19re establishing 30 new stores. They have the \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  Day Parade, they have the fireworks. We\u8217\'20\'19re angry, and even our customers comment on it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  said in an email in response to the strike and demands made by workers for a new contract: \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  seeks to reach a deal that is mutually beneficial to the colleague, company and union.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231122ejbm001uu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
