\par\par \uc2 Global development\par \b \uc2 Use of AI could create a four-day week for almost one-third of workers\b0\par\par\uc2 Philippa Kelly \par \uc2 541 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 November 2023\par 16:10 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Thinktank study highlights productivity gains, as well as improvement in work-life balance for 28% of the workforce in Britain and the US, as a result of implementing artificial intelligence\par \par \uc2 Artificial intelligence could enable millions of workers to move to a four-day week by 2033, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://autonomy.work/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chtgpt4UK.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new study}}}\uc2  focusing on British and American workforces.\par \par \uc2 The report from the thinktank Autonomy found that projected productivity gains from the introduction of AI could reduce the working week from 40 to 32 hours for 28% of the workforce \u8211\'20\'13 8.8 million people in Britain and 35 million in the US \u8211\'20\'13 while maintaining pay and performance.\par \par \uc2 The study says this could be achieved by bringing large language models (LLMs), such as ChatGPT, into workplaces to augment workers\u8217\'20\'19 roles and create more free time. According to Autonomy, such a policy could also help to avoid mass unemployment and reduce widespread mental and physical illnesses.\par \par \uc2 Will Stronge, the director of research at Autonomy, said: \u8220\'20\'1CToo many studies of AI, large language models, and so on, solely focus on either profitability or a jobs apocalypse. This study tries to show that when the technology is deployed to its full potential, but the purpose of the technology is shifted, it can not only improve work practices, but also improve work-life balance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The research found that 28 million workers, or 88% of Great Britain\u8217\'20\'19s workforce, could have their working hours reduced by at least 10% through the introduction of LLMs.\par \par \uc2 The local authorities of City of London, Elmbridge and Wokingham are among those that, according to the thinktank, hold the highest potential for workers, with 38% or more of the workforce able to reduce their hours in the coming decade.\par \par \uc2 A similar {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://autonomy.work/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chtgpt4-USv1.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 study conducted in the US}}}\uc2 , also by Autonomy, found that 35 million American workers could also move to a four-day week inside the same time frame. It found that 128 million workers, 71% of the workforce, could have their working hours reduced by at least 10%. States including Massachusetts, Utah and Washington were found to have the potential for a quarter or more of their workforces to move to a four-day week using LLMs.\par \par \uc2 Congressman Mark Takano, who has introduced a 32-hour work week bill to the \uc2 US Congress\uc2 , said: \u8220\'20\'1CFundamental changes are coming to our workforce due to AI and automation. It will take government action to ensure gains in efficiency are felt by all workers, regardless of industry or skill level.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In the UK and the US, Autonomy calls on public- and private-sector employers to take advantage of a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant opportunity to become world leaders in the take-up of workplace AI\u8221\'20\'1D, and to view this as an opportunity to improve the lives of hundreds of millions of workers. It also calls on policymakers to take action.\par \par \uc2 Stronge said: \u8220\'20\'1CWhat I think would be really impressive would be a robust AI industrial strategy, with automation hubs where trade unions, industry and experts in this tech get together to say: \u8216\'20\'18We\u8217\'20\'19re going to boost productivity, and this is also going to be something which delivers for the workers.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231120ejbk002bg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
